title CLI Flow

participant "User" as User
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "Command Parser" as Parser
participant "Intent Parser" as Intent
participant "Intent Resolver" as Resolver
participant "Discovery Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "Output Formatter" as Formatter

note over User, Formatter: === Command Execution ===

User->CLI: Execute i2vision command
activate CLI

CLI->Parser: Parse command line arguments
activate Parser
Parser->Parser: Extract command (discover, quality, contract)
Parser->Parser: Extract flags (--intent, --module, --depth, etc.)
Parser->Parser: Extract parameters
Parser->Parser: Validate arguments
Parser-->CLI: Parsed command
deactivate Parser

note over User, Formatter: === Intent Resolution ===

alt Intent-based discovery
    CLI->Intent: Parse intent from arguments
    activate Intent
    Intent->Intent: Extract goal (full_discovery, refactoring_analysis, etc.)
    Intent->Intent: Extract parameters
    Intent-->CLI: DiscoveryIntent
    deactivate Intent
    
    CLI->Resolver: Resolve intent to parameters
    activate Resolver
    Resolver->Resolver: Select base strategy
    Resolver->Resolver: Apply depth adjustments
    Resolver->Resolver: Apply focus adjustments
    Resolver->Resolver: Apply constraint overrides
    Resolver->Resolver: Convert to parameter set
    Resolver-->CLI: DiscoveryStrategy
    deactivate Resolver
else Preset-based discovery
    CLI->Resolver: Load preset
    activate Resolver
    Resolver->Resolver: Load preset file
    Resolver->Resolver: Validate preset
    Resolver-->CLI: ModifiableParameterSet
    deactivate Resolver
else Direct parameters
    CLI->CLI: Use direct CLI parameters
    note right of CLI: Parameters from flags
end

note over User, Formatter: === Pipeline Execution ===

CLI->Pipeline: Execute discovery with parameters
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Pipeline: Initialize discovery context
Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect architecture
Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect clusters
Pipeline->Pipeline: Execute parallel cluster discovery
Pipeline->Pipeline: Build contract registry
Pipeline->Pipeline: Validate contracts

Pipeline-->CLI: DiscoveryResult
deactivate Pipeline

note over User, Formatter: === Output Formatting ===

CLI->Formatter: Format results
activate Formatter

alt JSON output requested (--format json)
    Formatter->Formatter: Convert to JSON
    Formatter->Formatter: Pretty-print JSON
    Formatter-->CLI: JSON output
else YAML output requested (--format yaml)
    Formatter->Formatter: Convert to YAML
    Formatter->Formatter: Format YAML
    Formatter-->CLI: YAML output
else Human-readable output (default)
    Formatter->Formatter: Format summary
    Formatter->Formatter: Display key metrics
    Formatter->Formatter: Show violations
    Formatter->Formatter: Show recommendations
    Formatter-->CLI: Human-readable output
end

deactivate Formatter

CLI-->User: Display results
deactivate CLI

note over User, Formatter: === Command Examples ===

note right of User: Full discovery:\ni2vision discover --intent=full_discovery

note right of User: Module analysis:\ni2vision discover --intent=refactoring_analysis --module=i2vision-discover

note right of User: Quality metrics:\ni2vision quality --module=i2vision-discover

note right of User: Contract validation:\ni2vision contract validate --module=i2vision-discover

note right of User: With preset:\ni2vision discover --preset=spring-boot

note right of User: Custom depth:\ni2vision discover --intent=full_discovery --depth=deep
